  "body": "Stacked on #1745 (it edits the same Slot rows in `mill2d_more_page.rs`; retarget to `main` before #1745 merges, then `git merge origin/main`).\n\nWhat changed\n- Slot Geometry tab: A X / A Y / B X / B Y sit in their own \"Manual\" group (Slot width and #1745's extension rows stay outside it).\n- New `crates/ui/src/slot_manual_viz.rs`: A, B crosses and the A-B line, read off the page draft so they follow each edit before Apply. Ephemeral, no command; the committed edit is still the undoable params edit. Drawn only with no picked selection, Geometry tab open, resolvable top Z. Painted in `shell.rs` beside the other marks.\n- No posted-output change.\n\nTests (crates/ui, `egui_app::slot_manual_tests`)\n- the_hand_typed_ends_sit_in_a_manual_section\n- the_marks_follow_a_draft_edit_before_it_is_committed\n- no_marks_with_a_selection_or_off_the_geometry_tab\nMutation-checked (rename group, drop selection guard, drop tab guard, read committed A instead of draft): each goes red, restored and cmp-identical. Full `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib` 780 passed; clippy -D warnings clean.\n\nNot exercised: the `shell.rs` paint call itself (no test pins the stroke call; the mark geometry is pinned); no before/after screenshots (issue asks for them; skipped for budget); Selection-contains check is by layout order (Manual header below Selection, rows below Manual).\n\nChangelog: Slot: manual A/B fields in a \"Manual\" section; A/B points and line show in the viewport while edited\nEffort: medium\nProcess change: no\n\nFixes #1732\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
